<title>USA: Mcclatchy OK with upper range of estimates.</title>
<headline>Mcclatchy OK with upper range of estimates.</headline>
<dateline>SACRAMENTO, Calif 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>McClatchy Newspapers Inc said it was comfortable with the upper end of second quarter and full year estimates.</p>
<p>Analysts' estimates on First Call range from $0.41 per share to $0.45 for the second quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>First Call estimates for full-year 1997 range from $1.55 to $1.60 per share.</p>
</text>
